STYLE = ("Minimalist stick-figure characters: thin black line bodies and limbs, plain white circle heads with a black outline, tiny dot eyes and a short line mouth, adult proportions, nothing cute or childish. They stand in detailed, moody illustrated environments with cinematic lighting and depth: sickly mono-yellow walls, beige-brown damp carpet, buzzing fluorescent light, grey concrete, brick and pipes. Flat 2D illustration, not photorealistic. Blood, weapons and injuries can appear, drawn in the same simple illustrated way.")
